notes/aasjournal.bst
    BibTeX style file distributed by the American Astronomical Society,
    maintained by Amy Hendrickson with contributions from AAS staff. It is
    included unmodified because the file is required to build the notes and is
    not present in TeX Live under this name. All rights remain with its
    authors; it is redistributed here under the terms that accompany the
    AASTeX distribution.

This repository generates input for, and reads output from, several external
codes — MUSIC2, MUSIC2-monofonIC, CLASS, and SWIFT. None of their source code
is included here, and each carries its own license.
